<title>UK: Ldn silver fixed lower, gold stuck below $341.</title>
<headline>Ldn silver fixed lower, gold stuck below $341.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 471.25 cents from from 472.25. Quietly rangebound.</p>
<p>GOLD - Stuck below $341.00 after upside attempts fail despite early buying, but support well-built at $340.00. Quoted $340.55/$340.85.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Slips further to $373.75/$374.75, but forward market still tight while Russia export situation remains unresolved.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Retains gains at $155.25/$156.25.</p>
</text>
